    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners O'Brien Swaine and South East Estates are proud to present this stunning Showhouse in the superb new luxury development of three and four bedroom A rated homes by Mascool Developments Limited. Location is key and this development is just 40 minutes drive from Dublin, close to the M11 motorway exit and Gorey Arklow Towns are just a 10 minute drive.\n\nPrice includes all furniture, and the Home will be painted and wallpapered throughout with seeded gardens and all floors and appliances included. The development Showhouse has been finished by a professional interior designer. . \n\nWith all the benefits of a peaceful village setting in Coolgreany offering all amenities at hand along with the beautiful countryside of the Sunny South East. Dun Greine enjoys an excellent location being just minutes from the M11 motorway with Arklow and Gorey towns close by and Dublin a 40 minute drive. \n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "uPVC triple glazed Windows & doors fitted by K & K windows \nBespoke Fitted kitchen - appliances included \nMechanical extraction in kitchens , bathroom, utility, and en-suite\nplumbed for washing machine and dryer. \nAir to water heating system\nPainted internally\nWired for electric vehicle & Wired for intruder alarm \nHigh end tiling\nShaker doors throughout\nPainted & Wallpapered\nFully Floored\nLandscaped gardens\nMains - Electricity, Mains Sewerage, Mains (or Group) Water\n"
      },
      {
